  "GitHub is attesting and encrypting your archive. Wait for sealed-result in Artifacts, download and unzip it, then open delivery.tgwsealed in the wizard with your saved key.": "GitHub sedang memverifikasi dan mengenkripsi arsip Anda. Tunggu hingga sealed-result tersedia di Artifacts, unduh dan ekstrak berkas tersebut, lalu buka berkas delivery.tgwsealed di wizard menggunakan kunci yang telah Anda simpan.",
