  "Session metadata": "Metadata sesi",
  "Session revocation was not confirmed. End this session in Telegram Settings > Devices.": "Pencabutan sesi belum dikonfirmasi. Akhiri sesi ini di Pengaturan Telegram &gt; Perangkat.",
  "Settings accepted.": "Pengaturan diterima.",
