  "Files that are not downloaded keep their Telegram server hashes, so a copy obtained later can be checked against this archive.": "Fail yang tidak dimuat turun mengekalkan hash pelayan Telegram mereka, supaya salinan yang diperoleh kemudian boleh disemak menentang arkib ini.",
