  "Stories": "Kisah",
  "TEMPORARY CAPTURE · GITHUB ACTIONS": "RAGUAN SEMENTARA · GITHUB ACTIONS",
  "Takeout approval time will be added when Telegram reports it.": "Masa kelulusan Takeout akan ditambah apabila Telegram melaporkannya.",
  "Takeout can require confirmation in an established Telegram session, including after phone, QR or two-step login. Telegram sets the wait, which may exceed the session length chosen for this runner, including login and approval. A new runner creates a new login and may need approval again, cross-run resume is unavailable. A persistent local export can resume the same session but does not carry GitHub attestation.": "Takeout boleh memerlukan pengesahan dalam sesi Telegram sedia ada, termasuk selepas log masuk melalui telefon, QR atau log masuk dua langkah. Telegram menetapkan tempoh menunggu, yang mungkin melebihi tempoh sesi yang dipilih untuk pelari ini, termasuk log masuk dan kelulusan. Pelari baharu mencipta log masuk baharu dan mungkin memerlukan kelulusan semula, sambungan pelari silang tidak tersedia. Eksport tempatan berterusan boleh menyambung sesi yang sama tetapi tidak membawa pengesahan GitHub.",
  "Takeout only. Telegram usually refuses it for a session signed in less than 24 hours ago, and this runner always signs in fresh, so the capture may stop waiting for approval. Prefer Automatic.": "Takeout sahaja. Telegram biasanya menolak untuk sesi yang telah log masuk kurang daripada 24 jam lalu, dan runner ini sentiasa log masuk baharu, jadi tangkapan mungkin berhenti menunggu kelulusan. Utamakan Automatik.",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible HTML": "Telegram Desktop yang serasi HTML",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON": "Telegram Desktop, serasi JSON",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON and HTML": "Telegram Desktop, serasi dengan JSON dan HTML",
  "Telegram Takeout only": "TelegramTakeout sahaja",
  "Telegram requires export approval from another device that was already signed in before this request. The requesting session and a fresh login cannot approve it. After allowing the export there, click Check export approval. Telegram reported {delay} seconds of waiting, this runner has {remaining} seconds left. A new runner may require approval again.": "Telegram memerlukan kelulusan eksport daripada peranti lain yang telah log masuk sebelum permintaan ini. Sesi permintaan dan log masuk baharu tidak boleh meluluskannya. Selepas membenarkan eksport di sana, klik Semak kelulusan eksport. Telegram melaporkan masa menunggu {delay} saat, pelari ini mempunyai baki {remaining} saat. Pelari baharu mungkin memerlukan kelulusan sekali lagi.",
  "Telegram session revocation confirmed.": "Pencabutan sesi Telegram disahkan.",
  "Telegram two-step verification password": "Kata laluen pengesahan dua langkah Telegram",
  "Telegram's reported wait exceeds this session. Approve Takeout from an established session, or finish with the data already saved.": "Telegram",
  "TgWitness signed archive": "Arkib yang ditandatangani oleh TgWitness",
  "The built-in API credential pool is used by default, just like the normal workspace. You can sign in without entering API credentials.": "Kolam kelayakan API terbina dalam digunakan secara lalai, sama seperti ruang kerja biasa. Anda boleh log masuk tanpa memasukkan kelayakan API.",
  "The dialog list reached its limit; some chats may be missing.": "Senarai dialog telah mencapai hadnya; beberapa perbualan mungkin terlepas.",
  "The end date must be on or after the start date.": "Tarikh tamat mesti pada atau selepas tarikh mula.",
  "The export covers the cloud chats available to the fresh session, private chats included when selected. The export adds Telegram Desktop compatible views of the signed journal. The archive records limits, failures and any incomplete acquisition.": "Eksport merangkumi sembang awan yang tersedia untuk sesi baharu, termasuk sembang peribadi apabila dipilih. Eksport menambah paparan yang serasi dengTelegram Desktop untuk jurnal yang ditandatangani. Arkib merekodkan had, kegagalan dan sebarang pemerolehan yang tidak lengkap.",
  "The other side cleared the history; TgWitness keeps every message": "Pihak lain telah memadam sejarah; TgWitness menyimpan setiap mesej",
