  "Each selected chat becomes its own signed chat archive: full visible history, files by your rules, everyone who wrote with message counts and first and last message, the chat card, the admin log when this account can read it, and missing message-ID ranges rechecked one by one. Works for chats with content protection.": "Har bir tanlangan suhbat o'zining imzolangan suhbat arxivi bo'lib qoladi: to'liq ko'rinadigan tarix, fayllar sizning qoidalar bo'yicha, yozgan barcha ishtirokchilar xabar sonlari va birinchi hamda oxirgi xabari bilan, suhbat kartochkasi, bu hisob uni o'qiy oladigan paytdagi admin logi va yetishmayotgan xabar ID diapazonlari bittadan tekshiriladi. Kontent himoyalangan suhbatlar uchun ham ishlaydi.",
