  "Even the longest session, {minutes} minutes, is not enough for everything selected.": "Hatto eng uzoq sessiya,{minutes} daqiqa, tanlangan barcha narsalarni bajarish uchun yetarli emas.",
  "Everything is saved first. By default the runner stays invisible: no read receipts, no typing, and self-destructing content is not opened for the other side, so their timers do not start. Viewing saved files in this panel never notifies anyone. Every notice you allow and send is recorded in the journal.": "Avvalo hamma narsa saqlanadi. Standart bo'yicha runner ko'rinmas bo'lib qoladi: o'qilganligi haqida bildirishnoma yo'q, yozish belgisi yo'q va o'z-o'zini yo'q qiluvchi kontent boshqa tomon uchun ochilmaydi, shuning uchun ularning taymerlari ishga tushmaydi. Ushbu panelda saqlangan fayllarni ko'rish hech kimga xabar bermaydi. Siz ruxsat bergan va yuborgan har bir bildirishnoma jurnalga yozib olinadi.",
