  "GitHub is attesting and encrypting your archive. Wait for sealed-result in Artifacts, download and unzip it, then open delivery.tgwsealed in the wizard with your saved key.": "GitHub arxivni tasdiqlaydi va shifrlaydi. Artifacts bo'limidagi sealed-result ni kuting, uni yuklab oling va arxivni oching, so'ng saqlangan kalitingiz bilan ustavichkada delivery.tgwsealed ni oching.",
