  "Secret chat capture finished. The archive lists every recorded message, file and notice.": "Yashirin suhbat yozib olish tugallandi. Arxivda har bir yozib olingan xabar, fayl va bildirishnoma ro'yxatda ko'rsatilgan.",
  "Secret chat capture finished: {messages} messages ({received} received, {sent} sent), {files} files and {notices} service notices are signed into the journal.": "Yashirin suhbatni yozib olish tugallandi: {messages} xabar ({received} qabul qilingan, {sent} yuborilgan), {files} fayl va {notices} xizmat bildirishnomalari jurnalga imzolandi.",
  "Secret chats": "Yashirin suhbatlar",
  "Secret chats have no history on Telegram's servers. Only what arrives while this runner is active is recorded: messages, files, timers, deletions, screenshot and read notices. You can write from the capture screen; every message you send is recorded too.": "Maxfiy suhbatlarning tarixi Telegram serverlarida saqlanmaydi. Faqat ushbu runner faol bo'lgan paytda kelgan narsalar qayd etiladi: xabarlar, fayllar, taymerlar, o'chirishlar, skrinshotlar va o'qilganlik bildirishnomalari. Qayd etish ekranidan yozishingiz mumkin; yuborgan har bir xabaringiz ham qayd etiladi.",
  "Secret chats reported an error: {error}": "Maxfiy suhbatlar xato haqida xabar berdi: {error}",
  "Select at most 50 chats for one run.": "Bir ish jarayoni uchun ko'pi bilan 50 ta suhbatni tanlang.",
  "Select one or more chats, use Ctrl or Cmd with a click to add another, or Shift with arrow keys. An empty selection cannot start an account export.": "Bir yoki bir nechta suhbatni tanlang, yana birini qo'shish uchun Ctrl yoki Cmd tugmasini bosib suhbatni bosish yoki Shift tugmasi bilan o'q tugmalaridan foydalaning. Bo'sh tanlov hisobni eksport qilishni boshlamaydi.",
  "Select shown": "Ko'rsatilganini tanlang",
  "Select up to 50 chats. They are exported one after another, in this list's order.": "50 tagacha suhbatni tanlang. Ular ushbu ro'yxat tartibida ketma-ket eksport qilinadi.",
  "Selected attachments": "Tanlangan ilovalar",
