  "Selected chats, each as its own signed archive: authors, chat card, admin log and absent message IDs.": "Tanlangan suhbatlar, har biri alohida imzolangan arxiv sifatida: mualliflar, suhbat kartasi, admin yozuvlari va yo'q bo'lgan xabar IDlari.",
