  "Sign in, choose your export settings and start. When it finishes, return to the helper to open your encrypted archive.": "Kirish, eksport sozlamalarini tanlang va boshlang. Tamom bo'lgach, shifrlangan arxivni ochish uchun yordamchiga qayting.",
