  "Start or accept a secret chat and record every message, file, timer, deletion and screenshot notice while this runner is active.": "Maxfiy suhbatni boshlang yoki qabul qiling va ushbu runner faol bo'lgan paytda har bir xabar, fayl, taymer, o'chirish va skrinshot bildirishnomalarini yozib oling.",
  "Start secret chat": "Yashirin suhbatni boshlang",
  "Sticker": "Stiker",
  "Stickers": "Stikerlar",
  "Stories": "Hikoyalar",
  "TEMPORARY CAPTURE · GITHUB ACTIONS": "VAQTINCHA YIG'ISH · GITHUB ACTIONS",
  "Takeout approval time will be added when Telegram reports it.": "Takeout ma'lum qilganda, Telegram tasdiqlash vaqti qo'shiladi.",
  "Takeout can require confirmation in an established Telegram session, including after phone, QR or two-step login. Telegram sets the wait, which may exceed the session length chosen for this runner, including login and approval. A new runner creates a new login and may need approval again, cross-run resume is unavailable. A persistent local export can resume the same session but does not carry GitHub attestation.": "Takeout o'rnatilgan Telegram sessiyasida, jumladan telefon, QR yoki ikki bosqichli kirishdan so'ng ham tasdiqni talab qilishi mumkin. Telegram kutish vaqtini belgilaydi, bu esa login va tasdiqni o'z ichiga olgan holda ushbu runner uchun tanlangan sessiya muddatidan oshib ketishi mumkin. Yangi runner yangi kirishni yaratadi va yana tasdiqni talab qilishi mumkin, cross-run rejimini tiklash mumkin emas. Doimiy mahalliy eksport bir xil sessiyani davom ettirishi mumkin, lekin GitHub tasdig'ini o'z ichiga olmaydi.",
  "Takeout only. Telegram usually refuses it for a session signed in less than 24 hours ago, and this runner always signs in fresh, so the capture may stop waiting for approval. Prefer Automatic.": "Takeoutfaqat. Telegramodatda 24 soatdan kam vaqt oldin kirgan sessiya uchun ruxsat bermaydi, va bu runner har doim yangi kiradi, shuning uchun ma'lumotlarni yig'ish tasdiqni kutishni to'xtatishi mumkin. Avtomatikni afzal ko'ring.",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible HTML": "Telegram Desktop bilan mos keladigan HTML",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON": "Telegram Desktop bilan mos JSON",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON and HTML": "Telegram Desktop bilan mos JSON va HTML",
  "Telegram Takeout only": "TelegramTakeout faqat",
  "Telegram requires export approval from another device that was already signed in before this request. The requesting session and a fresh login cannot approve it. After allowing the export there, click Check export approval. Telegram reported {delay} seconds of waiting, this runner has {remaining} seconds left. A new runner may require approval again.": "Telegram bu so'rovdan oldin tizimga kirgan boshqa qurilmada eksportga ruxsat olishni talab qiladi. So'rov qilayotgan sessiya va yangi kirish buni tasdiqlay olmaydi. U yerda eksportga ruxsat berganingizdan so'ng \"Eksportga ruxsatni tekshirish\" tugmasini bosing. Telegram {delay} soniya kutishni xabar qildi, ushbu runnerda {remaining} soniya qoldi. Yangi runner yana ruxsat talab qilishi mumkin.",
  "Telegram session revocation confirmed.": "Telegram sessiyasining bekor qilinishi tasdiqlandi.",
  "Telegram two-step verification password": "Telegram ikki bosqichli tasdiqlash paroli",
  "Telegram's reported wait exceeds this session. Approve Takeout from an established session, or finish with the data already saved.": "Telegram",
  "TgWitness signed archive": "TgWitness imzolangan arxiv",
  "The built-in API credential pool is used by default, just like the normal workspace. You can sign in without entering API credentials.": "Ichki API kredensiallar havzasi odatdagi ish maydoni kabi standart bo'yicha ishlatiladi. API kredensiallarini kiritmasdan tizimga kira olasiz.",
  "The dialog list reached its limit; some chats may be missing.": "Dialog ro'yxati o'z chegarasiga yetdi; ba'zi suhbatlar yetishmasligi mumkin.",
  "The end date must be on or after the start date.": "Yakun sanasi boshlanish sanasida yoki undan keyin bo'lishi kerak.",
  "The export covers the cloud chats available to the fresh session, private chats included when selected. The export adds Telegram Desktop compatible views of the signed journal. The archive records limits, failures and any incomplete acquisition.": "Eksport yangi sessiyada mavjud bulutli suhbatlarni, shu jumladan tanlangan shaxsiy suhbatlarni ham o'z ichiga oladi. Eksport imzolangan jurnalning Telegram Desktop bilan mos ko'rinishlarini qo'shadi. Arxiv limitlarni, xatoliklarni va har qanday to'liq bo'lmagan ma'lumot olishni qayd etadi.",
  "The other side cleared the history; TgWitness keeps every message": "Qarshi tomon tarixni o'chirib tashladi; TgWitness esa har bir xabarni saqlaydi",
  "The other side deleted messages ({count}); TgWitness keeps them": "Boshqa tomon xabarlarni o'chirib tashladi ({count}); TgWitness ularni saqlab qoladi",
  "The other side opened self-destructing content": "Qarshi tomon o'z-o'zini yo'q qiladigan kontentni ochdi",
  "The other side set the self-destruct timer to {seconds} s": "Qarshi tomon o'z-o'zini yo'q qilish taymerini {seconds} soniyasiga o'rnatdi",
  "The other side took a screenshot": "Qarshi tomon skrinshot oldi",
  "The other side turned the self-destruct timer off": "Qarshi tomon o'z-o'zini yo'q qilish taymerini o'chirib qo'ydi",
  "The saved file could not be opened.": "Saqlangan faylni ochib bo'lmadi.",
  "The scope and settings are fixed once collection starts. Every mode uses the same approved GitHub runner, signed journal and encrypted delivery.": "Yig'ish boshlangandan so'ng doirasi va sozlamalari o'zgarmas bo'ladi. Har bir rejim bir xil tasdiqlangan GitHub runner, imzolangan jurnal va shifrlangan yetkazib berishdan foydalanadi.",
  "The secret chat could not be started: {reason}": "Yashirin suhbatni boshlash mumkin bo'lmadi: {reason}",
  "The selected volume exceeds the available time.": "Tanlangan hajm mavjud vaqtdan oshadi.",
  "The whole account or selected chats, like Telegram Desktop, with account data and readable views.": "Butun hisob yoki tanlangan suhbatlar, masalan, Telegram Desktop, hisob ma'lumotlari va o'qilishi mumkin bo'lgan ko'rinishlari bilan.",
  "This selection needs a {minutes}-minute session. Finish or cancel this run and start a new one with {minutes} minutes, or keep only the chats that fit.": "Ushbu tanlovga {minutes} daqiqalik sessiya kerak. Ushbu ishni yakunlang yoki bekor qiling va {minutes} daqiqalik yangi sessiyani boshlang yoki faqat sig'adigan suhbatlarni saqlang.",
  "Through date (UTC)": "Sanagacha (UTC)",
  "Time": "Vaqt",
  "Timer {seconds} s · kept here": "Timer{seconds}soniyalar · bu yerda saqlangan",
  "Too much for one run. Start these as separate runs, one GitHub run each:": "Bir marta ijro etish uchun juda ko'p. Bularni alohida-alohida ijro etishlar sifatida ishga tushiring, har biri alohida GitHub ijrosi bo'lsin:",
  "Total": "Jami",
  "Typing": "Yozish",
