  "Uses Takeout when Telegram allows it and the regular API otherwise. This runner signs in fresh, and Telegram usually refuses Takeout for sessions younger than 24 hours, so expect the regular API. The archive records which method was used.": "Telegram-dan foydalanadi, agar Telegram bunga ruxsat bersa, aks holda oddiy API-dan foydalanadi. Ushbu runner yangi sessiyada tizimga kiradi, va Telegram odatda 24 soatdan kam vaqtli sessiyalar uchun Takeout-ni rad etadi, shuning uchun oddiy API-dan foydalanishni kutish mumkin. Arxiv qaysi usul ishlatilganini qayd etadi.",
