  "Waiting for a secret chat. Start one above, or ask the other side to start one with this account.": "Yashirin suhbatni kutmoqda. Yuqorida yangi suhbatni boshlang yoki boshqa tomondan ushbu hisob bilan suhbatni boshlashni so'rang.",
