  "Each selected chat becomes its own signed chat archive: full visible history, files by your rules, everyone who wrote with message counts and first and last message, the chat card, the admin log when this account can read it, and missing message-ID ranges rechecked one by one. Works for chats with content protection.": "每个选中的聊天都将生成独立的签名聊天存档：完整的可见聊天记录、按您设定的规则筛选的文件、所有参与者的消息数量及首尾消息、聊天卡片、该账户可读取的管理员日志，以及逐一重新核查的缺失消息 ID 范围。支持启用内容保护功能的聊天。",
