  "Everything is saved first. By default the runner stays invisible: no read receipts, no typing, and self-destructing content is not opened for the other side, so their timers do not start. Viewing saved files in this panel never notifies anyone. Every notice you allow and send is recorded in the journal.": "所有内容都会先被保存。默认情况下，运行器处于隐身状态：无已读回执、无输入提示，且自毁内容不会被对方打开，因此对方的计时器不会启动。在此面板中查看已保存文件绝不会向任何人发送通知。您允许并发送的每条通知都会记录在日志中。",
