  "GitHub is attesting and encrypting your archive. Wait for sealed-result in Artifacts, download and unzip it, then open delivery.tgwsealed in the wizard with your saved key.": "GitHub 正在对您的存档进行认证和加密。请在 Artifacts 中等待 sealed-result 出现，下载并解压该文件，然后在向导中使用您保存的密钥打开 delivery.tgwsealed。",
  "Groups": "群组",
  "Hashes identify byte ranges of the selected photo or file. They let you compare an existing file later; they do not recreate a missing file. Avatars are a separate download choice.": "哈希值用于标识所选照片或文件的字节范围。它们可供您日后与现有文件进行比对，但无法重建已丢失的文件。头像可作为单独的下载选项。",
