  "If Telegram limits this account (spam block), it can start secret chats only with mutual contacts. Add each other to contacts, or let the other side start the chat: incoming chats are accepted either way.": "如果该Telegram账号被限制（垃圾信息封禁），则只能与互为联系人的人发起秘密聊天。请将对方添加到联系人中，或让对方发起聊天：无论哪种方式，收到的聊天请求都会被接受。",
