  "Secret chat capture finished: {messages} messages ({received} received, {sent} sent), {files} files and {notices} service notices are signed into the journal.": "秘密聊天捕获完成：{messages}条消息（{received}条已接收，{sent}条已发送）、{files}个文件和{notices}条服务通知已签名并记录到日志中。",
  "Secret chats": "秘密聊天",
  "Secret chats have no history on Telegram's servers. Only what arrives while this runner is active is recorded: messages, files, timers, deletions, screenshot and read notices. You can write from the capture screen; every message you send is recorded too.": "秘密聊天在 Telegram 服务器上不留任何记录。仅记录该运行器处于活动状态期间收到的内容：消息、文件、计时器、删除操作、截图以及已读通知。您可以在捕获界面中发送消息；您发送的每条消息也会被记录下来。",
  "Secret chats reported an error: {error}": "秘密聊天报告了错误：{error}",
  "Select at most 50 chats for one run.": "每次运行最多可选择 50 个聊天记录。",
  "Select one or more chats, use Ctrl or Cmd with a click to add another, or Shift with arrow keys. An empty selection cannot start an account export.": "选择一个或多个聊天室，点击时按住 Ctrl 或 Cmd 键可添加另一个，或按住 Shift 键配合方向键选择。若未选择任何聊天室，则无法开始账户导出。",
