  "Stories": "案例",
  "TEMPORARY CAPTURE · GITHUB ACTIONS": "临时捕获 · GITHUB ACTIONS",
  "Takeout approval time will be added when Telegram reports it.": "当 Telegram 报告相关数据时，将添加Takeout的审批时间。",
  "Takeout can require confirmation in an established Telegram session, including after phone, QR or two-step login. Telegram sets the wait, which may exceed the session length chosen for this runner, including login and approval. A new runner creates a new login and may need approval again, cross-run resume is unavailable. A persistent local export can resume the same session but does not carry GitHub attestation.": "Takeout 可能需要在已建立的 Telegram 会话中进行确认，包括通过手机、QR 或双重验证登录之后。Telegram 会设定等待时间，该时间可能超过为此运行器选择的会话时长，其中包含登录和批准过程。 新建的运行器会创建新的登录会话，可能需要再次批准，且不支持跨运行恢复。持久的本地导出文件可恢复同一会话，但不包含 GitHub 的认证信息。",
  "Takeout only. Telegram usually refuses it for a session signed in less than 24 hours ago, and this runner always signs in fresh, so the capture may stop waiting for approval. Prefer Automatic.": "仅限Takeout模式。Telegram通常会拒绝24小时内登录过的会话，而该运行器始终以新会话登录，因此数据捕获可能无需等待批准。建议选择“自动”模式。",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible HTML": "与 Telegram Desktop 兼容的 HTML",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON": "与 Telegram Desktop 兼容的 JSON",
  "Telegram Desktop compatible JSON and HTML": "与 Telegram Desktop 兼容的 JSON 和 HTML",
  "Telegram Takeout only": "仅限 Telegram Takeout",
  "Telegram requires export approval from another device that was already signed in before this request. The requesting session and a fresh login cannot approve it. After allowing the export there, click Check export approval. Telegram reported {delay} seconds of waiting, this runner has {remaining} seconds left. A new runner may require approval again.": "Telegram 要求由另一台在此请求之前已登录的设备批准导出。发起请求的会话和新登录的账户均无法批准此操作。在该设备上允许导出后，请点击“检查导出批准”。Telegram 报告等待时间为 {delay} 秒，该运行器还剩 {remaining} 秒。新的运行器可能需要再次获得批准。",
  "Telegram session revocation confirmed.": "已确认 Telegram 会话被撤销。",
  "Telegram two-step verification password": "Telegram 两步验证密码",
  "Telegram's reported wait exceeds this session. Approve Takeout from an established session, or finish with the data already saved.": "Telegram",
  "TgWitness signed archive": "TgWitness 签名存档",
  "The built-in API credential pool is used by default, just like the normal workspace. You can sign in without entering API credentials.": "默认情况下，系统会使用内置的 API 凭据池，这与普通工作区相同。您无需输入 API 凭据即可登录。",
  "The dialog list reached its limit; some chats may be missing.": "对话框列表已达到上限；部分聊天记录可能缺失。",
  "The end date must be on or after the start date.": "结束日期必须在开始日期之后或等于开始日期。",
  "The export covers the cloud chats available to the fresh session, private chats included when selected. The export adds Telegram Desktop compatible views of the signed journal. The archive records limits, failures and any incomplete acquisition.": "导出内容涵盖新会话中可用的云端聊天记录，若已选中，则包含私聊内容。导出文件中还包含与 Telegram Desktop 兼容的签名日志视图。存档记录了限制条件、失败情况以及任何不完整的采集操作。",
  "The other side cleared the history; TgWitness keeps every message": "对方清除了聊天记录；TgWitness 会保留每一条消息",
  "The other side deleted messages ({count}); TgWitness keeps them": "对方已删除{count}条消息；TgWitness 会将其保留",
