  "The saved file could not be opened.": "无法打开保存的文件。",
  "The scope and settings are fixed once collection starts. Every mode uses the same approved GitHub runner, signed journal and encrypted delivery.": "一旦开始收集，范围和设置即固定不变。每种模式均使用相同的经批准的 GitHub 运行器、签名日志和加密传输。",
  "The secret chat could not be started: {reason}": "无法启动秘密聊天：{reason}",
  "The selected volume exceeds the available time.": "所选音量超出了可用时间。",
  "The whole account or selected chats, like Telegram Desktop, with account data and readable views.": "支持像 Telegram Desktop 那样，可选择导入整个账户或特定聊天记录，并提供账户数据和易于阅读的视图。",
  "This selection needs a {minutes}-minute session. Finish or cancel this run and start a new one with {minutes} minutes, or keep only the chats that fit.": "此选项需要 {minutes} 分钟的会话时间。请结束或取消本次运行，并启动一个 {minutes} 分钟的新会话，或者仅保留符合条件的聊天记录。",
  "Through date (UTC)": "截止日期（UTC）",
  "Time": "时间",
  "Timer {seconds} s · kept here": "计时器 {seconds} 秒 · 保留在此处",
  "Too much for one run. Start these as separate runs, one GitHub run each:": "内容过多，无法在单次运行中完成。请将这些操作作为独立的运行任务分别执行，每个任务对应一次 GitHub 运行：",
