  "Use my own API credentials (optional)": "使用我自己的 API 凭据（可选）",
  "Uses Takeout when Telegram allows it and the regular API otherwise. This runner signs in fresh, and Telegram usually refuses Takeout for sessions younger than 24 hours, so expect the regular API. The archive records which method was used.": "当Telegram允许时使用Takeout，否则使用常规API。该运行器会重新登录，而Telegram通常会拒绝24小时内的新会话使用Takeout，因此预计将使用常规API。存档会记录所使用的方法。",
