  "Downloading…": "正在下載…",
  "Each selected chat becomes its own signed chat archive: full visible history, files by your rules, everyone who wrote with message counts and first and last message, the chat card, the admin log when this account can read it, and missing message-ID ranges rechecked one by one. Works for chats with content protection.": "每個選中的聊天室都會成為獨立的簽名聊天室存檔：完整的可見聊天紀錄、依照您設定規則的檔案、所有發言者的清單（含訊息數量、首則與末則訊息）、聊天室卡片、當該帳號可讀取時的管理員日誌，以及逐一重新核對的缺失訊息 ID 範圍。此功能適用於啟用內容保護的聊天室。",
  "End chat": "結束聊天",
  "Ended": "已結束",
  "Enter a @username, a phone number with + and the country code, or a numeric user ID.": "請輸入 @username、帶有 + 號及國家代碼的電話號碼，或數值型使用者 ID。",
  "Enter a @username, a phone number with + and the country code, or choose a person from your chats.": "請輸入 @username、以 + 開頭並附有國家代碼的電話號碼，或從您的聊天記錄中選擇一位聯絡人。",
  "Enter a valid API ID and API hash, or leave both empty.": "請輸入有效的 API ID 和 API hash，或將兩者皆留空。",
  "Enter a valid API ID and a 32-character hexadecimal API hash, or leave both fields empty.": "請輸入有效的 API ID 和 32 個字元的十六進位 API hash，或將兩個欄位均留空。",
  "Enter a whole media budget from 1 to 1024 GiB.": "請輸入 1 至 1024 GiB 之間的媒體預算總量。",
