  "Enter the phone number with its country code, for example +15551234567.": "請輸入包含國家代碼的電話號碼，例如 +15551234567。",
  "Established": "已建立",
  "Estimated files also exceed the selected download budget.": "預估檔案大小亦超出所選的下載配額。",
  "Even the longest session, {minutes} minutes, is not enough for everything selected.": "即使是最長的會話時間，{minutes} 分鐘，也不足以處理所有已選中的項目。",
  "Everything is saved first. By default the runner stays invisible: no read receipts, no typing, and self-destructing content is not opened for the other side, so their timers do not start. Viewing saved files in this panel never notifies anyone. Every notice you allow and send is recorded in the journal.": "所有內容都會先被儲存。預設情況下，執行器會保持隱形狀態：不會顯示已讀回執、不會顯示正在輸入的提示，且自毀內容對對方而言不會被開啟，因此對方的計時器也不會啟動。在此面板中檢視已儲存的檔案絕不會通知任何人。您允許並發送的每則通知都會記錄在日誌中。",
  "Everything selected fits this run.": "所有已選中的項目均適用於本次執行。",
