  "GitHub and the HTTPS tunnel remain trusted infrastructure. This is not confidential hardware. Messages deleted before capture and earlier edits cannot be recovered.": "GitHub 及 HTTPS 隧道仍屬可信賴的基礎設施。此非機密硬體。在擷取前已刪除的訊息及先前編輯的內容均無法復原。",
  "GitHub is attesting and encrypting your archive. Wait for sealed-result in Artifacts, download and unzip it, then open delivery.tgwsealed in the wizard with your saved key.": "GitHub 正在對您的檔案進行驗證與加密。請等待 sealed-result 中出現Artifacts檔案，下載並解壓縮後，使用您儲存的金鑰在精靈中開啟 delivery.tgwsealed 檔案。",
  "Groups": "群組",
