  "Secret chat capture finished: {messages} messages ({received} received, {sent} sent), {files} files and {notices} service notices are signed into the journal.": "秘密聊天擷取完成：{messages} 則訊息（{received} 則已接收，{sent} 則已傳送）、{files} 個檔案以及 {notices} 則服務通知已簽署並記錄於日誌中。",
  "Secret chats": "秘密聊天",
  "Secret chats have no history on Telegram's servers. Only what arrives while this runner is active is recorded: messages, files, timers, deletions, screenshot and read notices. You can write from the capture screen; every message you send is recorded too.": "秘密聊天在 Telegram 伺服器上沒有歷史紀錄。僅會記錄此執行器運作期間收到的內容：訊息、檔案、計時器、刪除紀錄、螢幕截圖及已讀通知。您可從擷取畫面發送訊息；您發送的每則訊息也會被記錄下來。",
  "Secret chats reported an error: {error}": "秘密聊天室報告錯誤：{error}",
  "Select at most 50 chats for one run.": "每次執行最多可選取 50 個聊天室。",
  "Select one or more chats, use Ctrl or Cmd with a click to add another, or Shift with arrow keys. An empty selection cannot start an account export.": "請選取一個或多個聊天室，按住 Ctrl 或 Cmd 鍵並點擊以新增其他聊天室，或按住 Shift 鍵並使用方向鍵選取。若未選取任何項目，則無法開始匯出帳戶資料。",
